doc: FwCanProduceSameManaTypeWith: the battlefield permanent can produce at least one type of mana the object the referent R names can also produce (gorge's canProduceSameManaTypeWith predicate over SpecContext.TriggerCard, engine/effects/filter_word_manatype.go; Mana Web's TapAll body). The producible set is the printed mana abilities' types: kop.CardDef.ProduceCol for WUBRG plus {C} when a printed mana ability makes it, the same census kernel mana_reflected.go producesColourless reads. R is RefTriggerObj for the kgen shape TriggeredCard.canProduceSameManaTypeWith+<type>. An unbound referent or an object that produces nothing matches nothing, fail closed.
